# Platform Identity & Subscription

See also SugamFlow rule `platform-identity-subscription.mdc`.

School ERP must **not** grow a separate long-term user or plan system. Use shared auth/user + platform subscription; school services only enforce feature-flags / entitlements from snapshots.

Phase 1 (current): Identity — role templates by business_type, invite UX, non-breaking adapters.
Phase 2: Unify subscription catalog; migrate school-local plans.
Phase 3: Super Admin cross-tenant user ops + audit.

Preserve existing school owner/staff JWT and `X-Tenant-Id` contracts while migrating.
